    pnDrainageAria: "Soil drainage",
    pnRibbonCheck: " I did a ribbon test: squeeze damp soil into a ribbon between thumb and finger. How far it gets before it breaks separates sand from loam from clay",
    pnRibbonHint: "Under an inch is sandy, one to two inches is loam, over two is clay. Ticking this records your texture as measured. It changes how we grade what we say, and gates nothing.",
    pnRibbonHintMetric: "Under {a} cm is sandy, {a} to {b} cm is loam, over {b} cm is clay. Ticking this records your texture as measured. It changes how we grade what we say, and gates nothing.",
